    <string name="settings_adb_guide">PatchWall Debloat Guide (ADB)</string>
    <string name="accessibility_service_description">MinimalTV Home Button Interceptor ensures pressing the Home button on your TV remote always opens MinimalTV launcher instead of Xiaomi PatchWall.</string>
    <string name="btn_close">Close</string>
    <string name="btn_done">Done</string>
    <string name="adb_guide_title">Bypass / Disable PatchWall via ADB</string>
    <string name="adb_guide_content">To permanently prevent Xiaomi PatchWall from overriding your default launcher, run these commands from your computer:\n\n1. Connect over Wi-Fi:\nadb connect %1$s:5555\n\n2. Disable Xiaomi PatchWall launcher:\nadb shell pm disable-user --user 0 com.mitv.tvhome\n\n3. (Optional) Disable Xiaomi ad services:\nadb shell pm disable-user --user 0 com.xiaomi.mitv.tvpush.tvpushservice\n\nTo restore if needed:\nadb shell pm enable com.mitv.tvhome</string>
